      "id": "r3",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "St. LXXII.—एकः केवलः भवतीति एकाकी (Râmarshi.) शस्य सुखस्य",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "अन्तः परिपूर्णता यस्य यस्मिन्निति वा ! (Râmarshi.).—Anushṭub.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r4",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "St. LXXIII.—कामदुघा. Siddh. Kaum. II., 339. Though I have",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "kept सन्मानिताः from C. as not incapable of explanation (from सन्+",
          "end": "join"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "मान with इतच्) still I prefer very much the reading संमानिताः.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "कल्पं स्थितम्. Comp. note on भ्रान्तं देशम्. This is an instance of “काल.”",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "This Stanza also at p. 315 of the Kâvyasangraha.—Vasantatilakâ.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r5",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "St. LXXIV.—I cannot make any sense out of the first line",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "as it stands. The reading in Bo.n. which I was not aware of",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "in the first instance as it does not occur in the regular list",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "of variæ lectiones, is more explicable—पट्टवस्त्र = silk cloth वर=",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "excellent (adjective). In the second line again Bo.n.’s reading",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "has propriety which C.’s reading has not. कदशन=bad things to",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "eat, Siddh. Kaum I., 475. व्यक्तम् would be better than व्यक्त. As it",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 8,
          "text": "stands the last line may be thus translated “what, too, if there",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 9,
          "text": "is not within that clear Glory of the Supreme by which all",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 10,
          "text": "worldly dangers are destroyed.”—Sragdharâ.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r6",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "St. LXXV.—मरणजन्मभय = the fear of [ever-recurring] birth",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "and death. स्नेहो न बन्धुषु Comp. Mohamudgara शत्रौ मित्रे पुत्रे बन्धौ",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "मा कुरु यत्नं विग्रहसन्धौ p. 33. of Kâvyasangraha. When there are",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "these things i. e. from भक्ति to वैराग्य, what more is to be asked",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "for or desired?—Vasantatilakâ.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r7",
      "type": "stanza_note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "St. LXXVI.—परम = परा उत्कृष्टा माशब्देन मायाख्या शक्तिर्यस्य अथवा परा",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "उत्कृष्टा मा शोभा यस्य तत्तथा! (Râmarshi). विकासि—Râmarshi reading विका-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "शि says विकाशः सदा उदयो विद्यते यस्य तद्विकाशि. नित्योदितमित्यर्थः which is",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "also the meaning of विकासि. Comp. St. 80 विकल्प = विकल्प्य (व्य in",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "original) न्ते स्मर्यन्ते विकल्पा विषयाः स्रक्चन्दनाङ्गनानिनादयः (Râmarshi.) Is",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "it not rather fancies, dreams? Comp. Uttararâmacharita विकल्पव्युपरमे",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "Act VI., यस्य refers, of course, to ब्रह्म. अनुषङ्गिणः = following after.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 8,
          "text": "अनुषङ्गः प्रसङ्गो विद्यते येषां ते तथोक्ताः अनुषङ्गिणः प्रसङ्गवतः पुरुषस्येव षष्ठी वा",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
